//  ID Bytes: 49 4D 44 20 //IMD  @ Address 0
//   History:
//   0.2  2023-10-23 R. Offner: GetSDR is new, better Integration with script "Imagedisk_Export.1sc"
//                              Better Handling of corrupted Reads (TotalSectors == 0)
//   0.1  2023-10-08 R. Offner: Initial release, Sector Cylinder Map and
//        Sector Head Map not implemented (optional Features)!
